  message: "Fixed. Merged via auto-pr. Suppresses partial-linker warnings when the ONLY met requirements are language-file presence checks (\\`*_files\\` names). On alertmanager: 8 warnings -> 1 (-87%). NAPI/TAURI_IPC/SOLIDITY_ABI/WASM_BINDGEN/IPC/LUA_FFI/RUBY_FFI/PYFFI all fall into this category — their 'partial' state on a polyglot repo was 'has the language files' but 0 actual pattern matches, which isn't signal. The remaining DEPENDENCY warning (Go repo with 0 TOML deps but 2785 import edges) is a different signal class and not addressed here."  # 0137
